sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor User as Guest/Patient/Coordinator
  participant UI as React Frontend
  participant API as Cloud Run API
  participant Cognito as AWS Cognito
  participant Dynamo as DynamoDB
  participant Firestore as Firestore Mirror
  participant PubSub as GCP Pub/Sub
  participant SNS as AWS SNS
  participant SQS as AWS SQS
  participant NLP as Natural Language API

  User->>UI: Open SAWS
  UI->>API: GET /services
  API->>Dynamo: Scan services table
  API-->>UI: Public services and pricing

  User->>UI: Register or login
  UI->>API: Auth requests
  API->>Cognito: Password registration/login
  API->>Dynamo: Store/read security question and cipher metadata
  API->>SNS: Registration/login event
  API-->>UI: User role and app token

  User->>UI: Book future appointment
  UI->>API: POST /appointments
  API->>API: Validate upcoming date/time
  API->>Dynamo: Write appointment
  API->>Firestore: Mirror appointment
  API->>SQS: Queue appointment notification
  API-->>UI: Appointment reference

  User->>UI: Submit support concern
  UI->>API: POST /messages/support
  API->>PubSub: Publish concern event
  API->>Dynamo: Write support message
  API->>Firestore: Mirror support message
  API-->>UI: Message reference

  User->>UI: Submit feedback
  UI->>API: POST /feedback
  API->>NLP: Analyze sentiment
  API->>Dynamo: Store feedback
  API->>Firestore: Mirror feedback
  API-->>UI: Sentiment result

  User->>UI: View dashboard or analytics
  UI->>API: GET protected resources with userId and role
  API->>Dynamo: Read scoped records
  API-->>UI: Patient-scoped or coordinator-scoped data
